                <pb facs="0172" n="76" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg76"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President of Chile to the President of the United
                        States.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santiago, Chile</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-09-16"><hi rendition="#italic">September 16,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The President of Chile, deeply moved by the catastrophe of Galveston, shares,
                    with all his heart, the sorrow of your country.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Federico
                    Errazuriz.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
